  description = E'The softing prevents the granules from swelling in the aquarium water or in the digestive tract of the fish and at the same time increases the acceptance of the food. With a grain size of approx. 0.1 mm, this complete food is excellently suited for the efficient rearing of fish larvae and juveniles and can help even the smallest representatives such as larvae of Bettas or Corydoras to become "big and strong". Since the fine granules are distributed almost evenly throughout the tank, the supply of the greatest possible number of young is guaranteed.',
