  description = E'Gently dried freshwater crabs are ground whole and fed into the granulate production process. As the shells of the animals are also processed, the end product impresses with a particularly high content of digestive fibre as well as xanthines and carotenoids, which make the colorful splendour of your ornamental fish shine in a natural way. Vitamins, minerals, omega 3 and 6 fatty acids increase the immune system and well-being of the fish.\n\n50% Freshwater Crab is a premium food for all omnivorous and carnivorous aquarium inhabitants.',
