  image_url = 'https://vumjslsogdnexehutibj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/products/discusfood/buffet-di-insect.jpg',
  description = E'Complete, complete extruded food for all ornamental fish species that require a species-appropriate diet with insects. Especially cichlids, bettas, tetras and catfish appreciate its taste and unique composition. It is very digestible, soft, not water turbid and it does not disintegrate. Its balanced content of nutrients, vitamins and minerals ensures healthy growth and optimal development of fish.',
  details = E'Ingredients: insect protein, wheat flour, wheat gluten, hermetia meal, krill meal, shrimp meal, spinach, corn, tubifex, silkworms, red mosquito larvae extract, brewer''s yeast, betaine, kale, fish oil, moringa, spirulina, garlic, multivitamin complex.\nAnalytical components: Crude protein 50%, crude fat 6.5%, crude ash 6.4%, crude fiber 2.9%.\nAdditives per kg: Vitamins: A (3a672a) 24000 IU, C (3a300) 180 mg, D3 (3a671) 1800 IU; with colorants; trace elements: Fe (3b103) 29 mg, Mn (3b502) 37 mg, Zn (3b603) 36 mg; with antioxidants.\nApplication: feed as much as the fish will eat within 3-5 minutes twice to three times daily. Do not overfeed the fish!\nStorage: Not for human consumption! Store in a cool, dry place!\nProduct Nr.: 20059',
