  description = E'Every ambitious discus keeper wants a tank full of champions. The animals should grow big, stay healthy and grow as old as possible with splendid colors. Since nutrition plays an essential role in this, Discusfood offers with the "Grand Champion Granulate" a balanced main feed, which makes it easier to achieve these goals. The targeted selection of the right vitamins and trace elements, combined with important energy suppliers of animal and vegetable origin, provides your charges with all the nutrients they need on a daily basis.',
  details = E'Ingredients: Fish meal, wheat gluten, krill meal, wheat, fish oil.\nAnalytical components: Crude protein 59%, crude fat 14.5%, crude ash 12.4%, crude fibre 0.7%.\nAdditives per kg: vitamins: A (3a672a) 25000 IU, D3 (3a671) 2500 IU; with colouring agents; trace elements: Mn (3b503) 12 mg, Zn (3b605) 30 mg; with antioxidants\nFeeding recommendation: Feed 2-3 times daily as much as the fish eat within 2-5 minutes. Do not overfeed the fish!\nStorage: Not for human consumption! Store in a cool, dry place!\nProduct Nr.: 20055',
