-- 31005  vitamin-shot  (vitamin-shot)
UPDATE public.products SET
  image_url = 'https://vumjslsogdnexehutibj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/products/discusfood/vitamin-shot.webp',
  description = E'Extra power for healthy, vibrant ornamental fish With Discusfood Vitamin Shot, you give your fish exactly what is often lacking in standard feed: an extra boost of essential vitamins and trace elements. As a liquid supplement, Vitamin Shot can be easily combined with almost any dry or frozen feed, thereby supporting your fish’s health, resilience and colour development in the long term.\n\nWhy a vitamin shot for fish? Even in an aquarium, fish can suffer from hidden deficiency symptoms – for example, due to vitamin loss during storage of the food, stress, transport or the strain of breeding. A targeted vitamin supplement: Vitamin Shot helps ensure your fish remain fit and healthy in the long term – far beyond what can be achieved with standard food alone.\n\nstrengthens the immune system and supports natural defences, promotes vitality, appetite and well-being, can aid recovery following stress, illness or transport, supplements daily feeding with essential micronutrients.\n\nEasy to use – maximum effectiveness Vitamin Shot has been developed to be particularly easy to integrate into your daily routine: practical videos from retailers demonstrate, step by step, how to add and mix Vitamin Shot into dry feed – without any additional tools or complicated preparation.\n\nFor mixing in: The Shot can be sprinkled directly over pellets, granules, flakes or frozen food and left to soak in briefly. This allows the vitamins to be absorbed by the food and consumed straight away. Flexible dosing: The amount can be adjusted individually depending on the stock, feeding regime and objective (e.g. breeding, rearing, recovery).\n\nFor all ornamental fish in freshwater aquariums Discusfood specialises in high-quality, practical feed and care products for discus and other demanding ornamental fish. Vitamin Shot fits perfectly into this range: sensitive species in particular, breeding groups, wild-caught fish or fish under increased stress benefit significantly from regular vitamin supplementation.\n\nfor discus and other cichlids, for shoaling fish and community tanks, also suitable for many other freshwater fish that benefit from an extra vitamin boost.\n\nIdeal supplement to daily feeding Vitamine Shot is not a substitute for a balanced main diet, but a targeted supplement to daily',
  details = E'Feeding recommendation: At trade fairs and in specialist articles, Vitamin Shot is described as ‘additional support beyond the normal diet’ – particularly with regard to health, immune defences and the long-term stability of the stock.\nStorage: Not for human consumption! Store in a cool, dry place!\nProduct Nr.: 31005',
  updated_at = now()
WHERE slug = 'vitamin-shot';

-- 25105  natural-humin  (natural-humin)
UPDATE public.products SET
  image_url = 'https://vumjslsogdnexehutibj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/products/discusfood/natural-humin.jpg',
  description = E'Natural Humin contains high purity humic substances produced for aquaristics and ponds. The raw products are pharmaceutically approved.\n\nNatural Humin binds pollutants, especially heavy metals in the water.\n\nThe light tanning effect provides optimal mucous membrane protection.\n\nSpawn fungus is prevented.\n\nThe healing process of lesions and wounds is supported.\n\nNatural Humic inhibits the growth of parasites, algae and fungi, reduces infection pressure.\n\nNatural humic acids provide yellow/brown coloration. A black water effect is created.\n\nNatural Humin is pH neutral.\n\nNatural Humin was developed and optimized for animals from blackwater biotopes, such as Rio Negro.',
  details = E'Application: Natural Humin is safe and easy to use. Recommended dosage for new aquariums is 10 ml per 100 l, depending on the desired coloration. If needed or if coloration decreases, 6 ml per 100 l should be re-dosed weekly.\nStorage: Not for human consumption! Store in a cool, dry place!\nProduct Nr.: 25105',
  updated_at = now()
WHERE slug = 'natural-humin';

