-- 31002  minerals-no-salt  (minerals-aloe)
UPDATE public.products SET
  image_url = 'https://vumjslsogdnexehutibj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/product-images/products/discusfood/minerals-aloe.webp',
  description = E'More than just minerals Minerals+ has been specially developed not only to provide ornamental fish with essential minerals, but also to allow them to benefit from the positive properties of selected natural substances.\n\nThe Plus stands for:\n\n✔ Aloe vera\n\n✔ Vitamin B complex\n\n✔ Humic substances\n\nThis combination supports the wellbeing, vitality and natural resilience of freshwater ornamental fish.\n\nAloe vera – supporting the natural protective layer\n\nAloe vera has been used successfully in the aquarium hobby for many years. The bioactive plant substances it contains can support the fish’s natural mucous membrane. The mucous layer acts as the first protective barrier against environmental influences.\n\nPossible benefits:\n\nSupport for the natural mucous membrane Promotion of recovery following stressful situations Support for general well-being Gentle care for sensitive skin areas Aloe vera is frequently used in aquariums to support the mucous membrane and reduce stress.\n\nVitamin B complex – support in stressful situations\n\nB vitamins are among the most important water-soluble vitamins for fish.\n\nThey play a role in:\n\nEnergy metabolism Nervous system function Cell metabolism General vitality Particularly during transport, acclimatisation, water changes or other stressful situations, an adequate supply of B vitamins can help support the fish’s organism.\n\nHumic substances – natural blackwater components\n\nHumic substances are among the most important natural components of many tropical waters, particularly in the native habitats of numerous ornamental fish such as discus, angelfish and tetras.\n\nScientific studies show that humic substances can possess a wide range of beneficial properties:\n\nSupport for the natural immune system Promotion of a natural aquatic environment Supporting the mucosal barrier Reducing stress-related strain Contributing to a natural, comfortable environment for freshwater fish Humic substances have been used successfully for years in aquaculture and ornamental fish keeping and are the focus of numerous scientific studies.\n\nThe result is a modern formula designed for demanding freshwater ornamental fish species.',
  details = E'Product Nr.: 31002',
  updated_at = now()
WHERE slug = 'minerals-no-salt';

